WEBVTT

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.650
A party of madness...

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:08.650
People called these beasts "Players".

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:16.310
Every night, the big names of high society
assembled in an arena deep underground.

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:21.870
Betting money on which Player would win was a secret hobby.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.010
The Players operated on instinct,

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:27.230
nothing but monsters capable of slaughter.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.420
There was no reason they should've
had any kind of free will like humans.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:34.930
Until that night...

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:52.330
The Players gained their own will.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.900
They killed all of the guests.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.040
13 Players escaped...

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:03.240
...along with two humans.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.090
Kanzaki! Bring it here!

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.590
No!

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.090
Wake up!

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:16.550
That doesn't belong only to you!

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.550
No! This child is mine!

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.930
Fight, Alphas!

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.060
It's Galactic Superman Alphas!

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:26.980
<b>Taking reservations now!</b>

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.570
Justice will be carried out every Monday at 7 PM!
<b>Taking reservations now!</b>

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.990
Call my name when you're in trouble!

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.200
I'll always be by your side!

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.240
I think I'm going to go home...

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.700
Huh? Why?

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.950
Aren't you scared of the serial killer?

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.330
Just last night...

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:47.920
It was in a train, right?

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.170
It's amazing!

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.340
Someone got on the train like always
and just cut somebody straight in half!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:54.340
I'm going home! I'm scared!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:57.340
Wouldn't it be interesting, though, if right before our eyes-

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:14.610
Another one for the whirlwind demon...

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:17.280
Inspector. The crime lab's arrived.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.110
OK, please start.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.120
With this many people out in broad daylight,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.460
why wasn't there an eyewitness?

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.590
This makes five people.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.130
It's not five.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.630
How many victims have there been in the past ten years?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.680
We need to hurry before the world notices.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.640
It's my responsibility to find this child.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.020
But we don't have any leads now.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.650
Is it possible he's already dead?

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.480
That thing is a demon.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.650
Even if you kill him, he won't die.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.610
I'm off!

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:03.820
Jin, wait!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.330
You forgot this.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.370
I'm fine, Jii-chan!

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.960
You'll meet with your friend of justice, right?

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.710
He's just following me on his own.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.960
You're saving people together, aren't you?

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.880
I'm just working.

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:24.470
If that's the case, there's something I want you to remember.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:28.720
If you're beating up bad guys with no intent of saving someone,

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.640
that's just violence, not justice.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:33.400
Justice?

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.770
Even when it <i>is</i> for justice, you're still hurting someone,

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:40.150
and resentment festers in those wounds and leads to more violence.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:42.860
If they get injuries, won't they just heal?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:44.570
You're always telling me that, Jii-chan!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.450
Are you talking about self-healing?

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:51.540
No, I'm not talking about those wounds, but those of the heart.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.420
And that's another lesson?

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:55.750
That's right!

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.920
It's a lesson! Something very important.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.420
I don't really get it, but I'll remember it!

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:03.430
OK, then, go.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.340
Don't forget this!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.430
The feeling of saving someone is more important than beating somebody.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:11.430
Got it!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:14.350
I see you're working hard!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.940
Yeah! I'll do my best!

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.700
Hey, just give up already.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:32.660
It's better to have a good time!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:35.170
Guys who say that kind of thing are always bad in bed.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:39.880
Cute, isn't it? She's totally terrified now!

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:40.920
Hey.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.430
You in trouble?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.180
Yes, I'm in a <i>lot</i> of trouble!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.800
What are you doing, Brat?

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:52.310
I don't mind helping you, but I want 10,000 yen as a reward.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.810
It's yours, it's yours! I'll pay 10,000!

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:56.310
Deal!

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:59.820
That's just violence, not justice!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.000
You...!

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.150
You OK?

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:41.640
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:44.150
You're really strong, kid!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.370
Kouga, it's already over.

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.490
I knew it!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.660
Didn't I tell you to call me if you saw a crime?!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.660
I don't have time for that.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.880
We're a team! Me, you, and Konoha.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.130
We spot a crime, get a grasp of the situation,

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.670
create a countermeasure, and deal with it.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.180
The three of us cooperating is the most important thing in that!

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.720
Great... Onii-chan's at it again.

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:15.100
You guys are great!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.430
Are you out on patrol?

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:18.250
Yes!

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:20.190
Because we're the allies of justice.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:22.730
10,000 yen.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.570
Cut it out! Let's go.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:27.070
Hey, 10,000 yen!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:28.570
Hey, let me go!

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.410
My 10,000 yen!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:32.030
Hey, wait!

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:35.820
Listen up, Jin!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:38.460
Justice doesn't ask for a reward.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.750
You're so high-and-mighty...

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.550
Oh, it's the same?

00:06:42.550 --> 00:06:43.710
I have one too!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:46.960
Oh, this? It's nothing.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:52.470
You got an angel's ring, too!

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:53.850
Huh?

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.270
An angel's ring?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.350
Jii-chan calls it that.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.020
But he told me to cover it up!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.990
I'll show it to you guys, but this is a secret.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.360
A secret just for us, then.

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:13.870
But mine's just a regular injury!

00:07:13.870 --> 00:07:14.870
An injury?

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.160
"Put spit on that and it'll heal."

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.370
"Humans have a self-healing ability."

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.960
You sure know a lot.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.840
Jii-chan told me that!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.850
You haven't experienced enough killing yet, have you?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.690
Want to do things more extravagantly?

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.610
There's something I want your help with.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.030
I finally found you!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:56.620
Where are those other kids?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.620
They went home.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:00.370
They got a phone call and apparently something came up all of a sudden.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.380
You guys are busy, huh.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.080
Well, here you go!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:08.210
10,000 yen!

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.010
I promised I'd pay you.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:13.340
Take this, too. It's where I work.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.260
If you come by before nightfall, I'll treat you to dinner!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.300
See you!

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.350
Oba-san, thanks!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.740
Jii-chan!

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.000
Jii-chan!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.210
What happened?!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.250
You're hurt!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.250
Jin-kun.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.050
If you're hurt, just put some spit on it and it'll get better!

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:52.510
You're always telling me that.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.350
You'll be fine now.

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:01.270
The bleeding will stop soon.

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:04.440
Everybody's sleeping really funny outside.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.520
What happened to them?

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:08.770
They're not sleeping.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.610
Everyone's... dead.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.740
What does "dead" mean?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.910
Want to have a lesson?

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:17.860
No thanks.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.530
By the way, I did a job today!

00:09:20.780 --> 00:09:25.960
Sorry, it was a little violent, but the person I saved was really happy!

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:29.380
Jii-chan?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.250
Jin, this is your last lesson.

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.420
Everyone ended up this way because of violence.

00:09:36.090 --> 00:09:41.510
I'll show you what happens as a result.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.310
Jii-chan?

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:56.030
Jin, with this you'll get a little weak, but...

00:09:56.570 --> 00:10:00.070
...that makes me happy.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.420
Hey, Doctor! Hey!

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.050
What do you think you're doing?!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:13.960
Come back tomorrow.

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:17.300
My grandfather stopped moving!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.470
Please heal him!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.390
You need money for an exam.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:23.720
Money. Do you have any?

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.230
If it's money, then... here!

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:30.060
Don't screw around!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:35.110
Hey, I messed up!

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.650
I do have money! 10,000 yen!

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.580
Let's live in a house like this next time.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:53.630
Why say that out of nowhere?

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.130
Doesn't it look fun?

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.630
I want to live in a big house like this with you!

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:03.970
That's right, I'd be really happy if I could
live properly together with you like that.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:06.890
Let's start looking for a house for us, then!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:07.890
That's impossible!

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:12.400
We'd need a lot of money for a splendid house like this.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:16.150
Then I'll save the money for it!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:32.960
What is this...?

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.510
Kouga...

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.100
Never play with that homeless kid again.

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:57.150
If society found out that you were hanging out with some kid from Undertown,

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.860
the Amagi family would become a subject of ridicule!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.530
Why didn't you tell me about this sooner?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:06.490
I'm sorry.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.540
Konoha, please stop crying.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.000
Okaa-san!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.290
You don't seem to be aware that you're Amagis.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.500
Otou-san!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:19.840
That kid is a Kid of Justice.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.340
And he's strong!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:26.550
I want to have the kind of strength that he has to save people!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:27.510
That sound...

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.390
What's that?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:36.400
It kept ringing in Kouga-sama's room.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:38.570
It's a call from Jin!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:42.190
Tou-san, give it back!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.700
From the homeless kid?

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.590
<b>Pink
Peach
Sexy Pub</b>

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:08.180
<b>Sexy Pub Pink Peach</b>

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.970
Someone wants to see me?
<b>Sexy Pub Pink Peach</b>

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:13.930
It's some dirty kid, and he's really persistent!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.730
Ah, it must be that kid!

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:18.900
Hey, so you came, kid!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.650
What's wrong?

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:24.780
It's strange.

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.990
I'm remembering nothing but good times.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.950
But I can't smile...

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.450
<b>Central
General
Hospital</b>

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.450
It's the same?

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:36.960
We're waiting for details from the autopsy,

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.460
but it seems he was killed by the same method that serial killer uses.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.050
Understood.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.100
So, what's your relation to him?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.980
Well, we're friends... Right?

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.400
You can go home now.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:02.150
Please leave the rest to us.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:04.900
Well, when it's decided what facility he's going to,

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:05.990
please give me a call.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:08.860
See you, kid.

00:14:08.860 --> 00:14:09.910
Yeah...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.760
Kid, why don't you stay at my place tonight?

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:40.690
I'll clean your clothes, so wash up really well and warm up!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.830
You're awful, Oba-san!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.540
I keep telling you I'm no "Oba-san"!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:10.510
My name's Akemi, not Oba-san.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.010
I'm Akemi <i>Onee-san</i>, OK?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.060
What's your name?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.720
Me? Jin.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.090
Jin-kun?

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:19.300
How do you write that?

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.520
With the kanji for "person."

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:25.570
You're coming in, too?

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.570
It's fine, let me in!

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.740
The water'll get cold!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:31.950
Then I'll-

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.160
What're you doing?!

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.870
Oh, are you shy?

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:40.660
Haven't you ever taken a bath with your mother?

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.130
I don't know my mum.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.670
Or my "father", either.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:49.370
I don't have either of those!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:50.670
Jii-chan told me that.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.520
The second time...

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:04.860
What?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.520
It's the second time I've had this warm feeling.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:13.450
Jii-chan did this before he stopped moving.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.370
Oba-san's warm, too.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.660
Don't call me "Oba-san".

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:21.500
Earlier the police officer told me I can't see Jii-chan anymore.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.420
Is it true? Why?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.000
What does it mean to have "died"?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.290
Why can't I meet him again?

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.050
I don't want that!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.880
I want to see Jii-chan!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.050
I want to see him!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:37.550
Oba-san, what is this?

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.310
What's wrong with me?

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.980
Jii-chan!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.200
We found Kanzaki Gorou.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:03.710
The police took in the body as a John Doe.

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.960
Collect it immediately.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:07.460
Is Zet together with him?

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.500
We don't know.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:12.880
But he was with a child around ten years old and a young woman.

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:14.380
A child?

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.560
Wow, a perfect fit!

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.690
Let's go shopping!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:36.990
Oba-san!

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.960
No, no! Let's have fun.

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:49.250
Run, Jin-kun!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.130
No way!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.540
You're bleeding a ton.

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:52.750
You can't die!

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.380
If you die, I can't see you again!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.230
How is it? Does it hurt?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:06.770
Jin-kun!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.730
That old guy last night was pretty interesting, too.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:14.070
You're the guy who used violence on Jii-chan?

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:32.130
Jin-kun, hang in there!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:33.760
Jin-kun!

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:37.130
You're in the way!

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.640
I love hearing 'em scream!

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.410
Right now, I'm...

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:08.460
...totally free!

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:10.580
Take this!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.210
This'll finish you!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.620
This guy is... Charisma...

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:20.780
Grow up quickly.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:23.700
Haitani-san.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:26.160
Why are you here?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.120
I came to take down the guy who broke the law.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:31.040
Selfishly reverting...

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.910
How immature of him.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:35.750
Then you killed this man?

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.380
What a mess.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.920
Even though we just want to live our lives quietly.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:42.920
I'll leave the clean-up to you, all right?

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:46.430
Of course. It's my job.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:53.440
What will you do with the humans?

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.940
I'll leave them alone.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:59.110
It's our rule not to get involved with them.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.450
You got into trouble again.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:17.830
This is a memento from your grandfather.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:21.590
Jii-chan's...?

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:25.090
Today and yesterday have been really tough for you, kid.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:32.560
You've got to hold your head up high when times are tough.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:34.980
You won't find any hope rolling around on the ground!

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.230
What's hope?

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.730
Well, that's...

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.740
Your hope...

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:48.740
...must be this person.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:51.740
Oba-san!

